  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **albino sunburn girl**: back after 37 archived shows (586 days); rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **i'll be yourjonny on the spot**: cut on the recording [3]\n- **i'll be your jonny on the spot**: cut on the recording [3]\n- **ohio/ tender situation**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2009-09-02** (recommended): source not stated; 34 songs; 164 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says there is a glitch in the recording that sounded rather bad [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says other tapers were at the Pomona show, but they were the only taper at the Grove [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2009-09-02**: Recorded on a Zoom H2 at 120° wide stereo setting, then processed through Sound Forge 9 and an Isotope limiter; Taper hhh dingo (Cary P.) stood about 10 feet off center toward stage left, 40-50 feet from stage, at the first-tier rail, with a tripod at 7 feet; Transfer chain went from WAV 48/16 to FLAC, then to CDR, then EAC extraction and back to FLAC [1][2]",
